  Slug: reef-merfolk
  DisplayName: Reef Merfolk
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/spells/prismatic-armor.webp
  Description: You were raised amid colorful corals and schools of tropical fish.
    Compared to most merfolk, your body is vividly hued with stripes, spots, and
    patterns like a clownfish or angelfish. You're used to the occasionally toxic
    denizens of your home and are bothered little by stings or petty poisons. You
    gain poison resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1), and each of your
    successful saving throws against a poison affliction reduces its stage by 2,
    or by 1 for a virulent poison. Each critical success against an ongoing poison
    reduces its stage by 3, or by 2 for a virulent poison.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Howl of the Wild
